msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san? It's me, Shibayama, the guy who asked you to\r\n"
"help collect that loan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Oh, hey. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I got a call from somebody claiming he saw Motoyama. Says\r\n"
"he's out drinking somewhere in the Champion District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Could you visit the bars there and look for him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Got it, I'll head over to the Champion District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Yeah, thanks. I'll give you ten percent as a reward if you\r\n"
"can collect that loan."
msgstr ""

